            note: "Joined by threaded or welded fittings. Aboard a ship 46 CFR 56.80-5 lets steel pipe be bent by any hot or cold method to any radius meeting ASME B31.1 (R5); no pipe bender row is here yet, so it turns with fittings until one is.",
            sizes: [
