            note: "Bent with a hand bender (data/piping/benders.ron, R24) or turned with cast-metal fittings; exposed, it runs parallel with or at right angles to walls and ceilings (UFGS 26 20 00, R26). Each size's Bender radius is the 2014 NEC's minimum (358.24, Chapter 9 Table 2, R45), the one-shot and full-shoe bender column, to the centreline; the dimensions are Wheatland Tube's sheet, made to ANSI C80.3 (R50); the DN is the NEC's metric designator.",
